sequenceDiagram
    title BLE GATT Discovery Flow: Services, Characteristics, Descriptors

    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer / ATT events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through Echo callbacks.

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 1. Service Discovery
        App->>Node: GattClient.StartServiceDiscovery()
        Note over Node, Peripheral: ATT_READ_BY_GROUP_TYPE_REQ over primary-service range.
        loop 0..n services
            Peripheral-)Node: ATT_READ_BY_GROUP_TYPE_RSP entries
            Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x180F,<br>handles={startHandle=0x0020, endHandle=0x0028})
        end
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.ServiceDiscoveryComplete(success)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 2. Characteristic Discovery (once per service)
        loop For each discovered service
            App->>Node: GattClient.StartCharacteristicDiscovery(<br>startHandle=service.handles.startHandle,<br>endHandle=service.handles.endHandle)
            loop 0..n characteristics
                Peripheral-)Node: ATT_READ_BY_TYPE_RSP entries
                Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.CharacteristicDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x2A19, declarationHandle=0x0024,<br>valueHandle=0x0025, properties=0x12)
            end
            Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.CharacteristicDiscoveryComplete(success)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 3. Descriptor Discovery (once per characteristic)
        note left of App: Descriptor range for a characteristic:<br>startHandle = characteristic.valueHandle<br>endHandle = nextCharacteristic.declarationHandle - 1<br>(or service.handles.endHandle for the last characteristic).
        loop For each characteristic
            App->>Node: GattClient.StartDescriptorDiscovery(<br>startHandle=0x0025, endHandle=0x0028)
            loop 0..n descriptors
                Peripheral-)Node: ATT_FIND_INFORMATION_RSP entries
                Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.DescriptorDiscovered(<br>uuid=0x2902, handle=0x0026)
            end
            Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.DescriptorDiscoveryComplete(success)
        end
    end
